  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UTP: UNDP Mykolaiv Strategic Partnership 2025-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to accelerate the process of reconstruction in Mykolaiv, normalising the situation for the current population, facilitating the reintegration of IDPs and refugee returnees, and addressing the specific needs of vulnerable groups to ensure that no-one is left behind. 
UNDP is implementing partner.</narrative>
  </description>
